# The Energy Synchronize Maneuver opened for the two Allies till the end of your next turn: Debug's Maneuver Access on their sheets - the
# table's, said on its card.
source: Appointed God
description: >
  Two willing Allies gain access to the Energy Synchronize Maneuver until the end of your next turn.
text: >
  Space-Time Connection: You possess the ability to link two people together in such a way that their life energy becomes one.
  –Ability Type: Magical
  –Prerequisites: N/A
  –TP Cost: N/A
  –KP Cost: 10(T)
  –Maneuver Type: Standard
  –Action Cost: 3 Actions
  –Minions: Non-Minion
  –Passive Bonus: N/A
  –Effect: Target 2 willing Allies. Those Allies gain access to the Energy Synchronize Maneuver (see — Fusion of Ki) until the end of your next turn.
